WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.007
What’s the worst thing that’s happened to you today?

00:00:03.007 --> 00:00:04.979
Well, I lost my luggage.

00:00:04.979 --> 00:00:05.917
That explains the shirt.

00:00:06.041 --> 00:00:10.051
I made my hotel reservation 11 and a half months ago.

00:00:10.054 --> 00:00:11.354
They got cancelled last month,

00:00:11.354 --> 00:00:13.716
and I only got a place today for two nights. 

00:00:14.056 --> 00:00:16.557
Hey, I’m Traci in San Diego outside the Team Coco house.

00:00:16.557 --> 00:00:20.767
And today, State Farm and Team Coco have paired up
to turn a few lucky fans day around.

00:00:20.772 --> 00:00:22.028
Are you a big Conan O’Brien fan?

00:00:22.028 --> 00:00:22.506
Yes.

00:00:22.506 --> 00:00:24.118
Can you do an impression of Conan?

00:00:24.129 --> 00:00:25.129
Oh, yeah, totally.

00:00:29.110 --> 00:00:32.824
Yes! I mean, are you Conan O’Brien?

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:34.749
Um, I don’t think I’m tall enough.

00:00:34.754 --> 00:00:36.417
I see the resemblance.

00:00:36.418 --> 00:00:38.900
What’s the worst thing that’s happened today?

00:00:38.902 --> 00:00:41.751
Oh, well, it’s always like the lines,
and everything like that. 

00:00:41.751 --> 00:00:43.806
And people cutting.
I mean, that’s horrible.

00:00:43.808 --> 00:00:46.625
Were you behind anybody that was
just, like, heinous?

00:00:46.628 --> 00:00:48.719
Sometimes people are smelly because it’s hot.

00:00:48.722 --> 00:00:51.810
People do kinda smell, I’ve realized that throughout the day.

00:00:51.813 --> 00:00:55.342
You’ve been banking on something for 11 months
and then it fell through today?!

00:00:55.345 --> 00:00:57.368
Yes. But I’m here now, it’s okay.

00:00:57.372 --> 00:00:58.620
You know who else is here?

00:00:58.621 --> 00:01:00.544
State Farm is here to help life go right.

00:01:00.546 --> 00:01:01.562
Oh, thank you!

00:01:01.562 --> 00:01:04.061
You gonna collect a lot of those 
tiny, little baby hats?

00:01:04.066 --> 00:01:04.795
Yes!

00:01:04.795 --> 00:01:06.795
Do you feel like your day is about to turn around?

00:01:06.798 --> 00:01:08.389
Um, I’m hoping so.

00:01:09.196 --> 00:01:10.863
I have one more little gift for you.

00:01:11.086 --> 00:01:12.299
I have for you

00:01:12.765 --> 00:01:17.126
two tickets to a live taping of Conan O’Brien, tonight!

00:01:18.464 --> 00:01:20.957
Oh my goodness. Oh my god!
They’re so hard to get.

00:01:20.957 --> 00:01:22.542
I’m going to CONAN!

00:01:23.294 --> 00:01:25.353
Thank you State Farm for turning my day around!

00:01:28.824 --> 00:01:32.080
You gotta go, left, right…yeah, that’s feeling good.

00:01:32.557 --> 00:01:33.767
I’m nailing this.

